00:32:55.520 --> 00:32:57.160 line:72%
 C'est vraiment raciste 
 de dire 

00:32:57.320 --> 00:32:58.880 line:78%
<c.yellow> que les Noirs doivent penser </c>

00:32:59.040 --> 00:33:01.320 line:72%
